  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outgoing study visit Ginger</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This study visit supports the CBI&#x2019;s ginger programme &#x2018;Transition to a sustainable and high-quality ginger sector in Nigeria 2021-2025&#x2019; in which three pathways of change are envisaged:&#x2022;	Nigerian ginger small- and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) are competitive, sustainably exporting and have market access.&#x2022;	A functioning service delivery model and coordination for the ginger export sector.&#x2022;	A functioning service delivery model and coordination for the ginger sector supply side.	With the programme drawing to a close, this buyer mission to Nigeria has the aim to strengthen the private sector and economic cooperation, leading to more direct sourcing of ginger from Nigeria.</narrative>
  </description>
